{"sourceUrl":"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/zs/zs01/1419186.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:58.021881+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/zs/zs01/1419186.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>为促进高校优秀大学生之间的交流，我院将于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月举办</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。本次夏令营拟招收营员</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>150</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>人（含校内、校外），主要活动有学术讲座、营员交流、参观校园等。本院意向留院攻读研究生的大三学生必须报名。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>一、申请资格</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，政治思想品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>国内高校全日制在校三年级本科生（即</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>届毕业生）。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩优秀，英文听说读写能力良好，全国大学英语六级考试成绩不低于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>426</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>分。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>二、申请材料</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>中山大学电子与通信工程学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请表（见附件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，推荐意见及所在院系意见需签名、盖章）；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本科阶段学习成绩单</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>份（须由学校教务部门盖章）；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本科前五个学期同年级专业总成绩排名证明</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>份（须由学校教务部门盖章）；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span> 4.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学生证及身份证复印件各</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>份（学生证须将封面及个人信息页正反面复印在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>纸同一面上，身份证须将正反面复印在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>纸同一面上）；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>英语水平证明复印件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>份（包括国家四、六级考试成绩，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>GRE/GMAT</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩等）；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>个人简历一份；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>其它证明材料，如代表性学术论文、获奖证书、专利证书复印件等材料复印件（其中已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页，未发表论文提供单页摘要）。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>三、申请流程</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>时间：即日起至</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>将全部申请材料按顺序扫描整理为同一个</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>文件（文件名为</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本科就读学校</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>姓名</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>），于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日前在</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名，并上传</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>附件。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>提交纸质材料</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学院网站公布夏令营入选名单后，取得入营资格的同学请在报到时将全部申请材料纸质版（第</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>需提供原件）提交至报到处。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>申请人须对所提交材料的真实性负责，经审核若发现存在材料虚假或材料不合格者，将取消入营资格。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>四、材料审核</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>        1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营资格审核后，将于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日前在中山大学电子与通信工程学院网站（</span></span></span></span><a href=\"http://sece.sysu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>http://sece.sysu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></a><span><span><span><span>）上公布入营名单，未入营者不再另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>        2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>入营同学请按照日程安排要求，按时报到。如因特殊情况不能参加本次夏令营，请于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日前告知我院。夏令营活动期间，所有营员须遵守我院相关规定，报到后应全程参加夏令营各项活动。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>五、初步活动安排</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日至</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日，共</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>天。若有变化将另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>本次夏令营采取线下形式，举办地点：中山大学深圳校区（广东省深圳市光明区公常路</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>66</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>号中山大学深圳校区）。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日程安排：</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日：营员报到，开营典礼，专业介绍；</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日：学术讲座，师生交流，分组讨论、活动总结等。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>注：本日程为暂定计划，具体安排以报到时公布为准。夏令营期间我院提供食宿，交通费用自理。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>群：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1045402404</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（中大电通</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>夏令营）</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>联系人：蓝老师</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>0755-23260175</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>地址：广东省深圳市光明区公常路</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>66</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>号中山大学深圳校区工学园</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>栋</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>北</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>503</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>室（邮编：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>518107</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>电子与通信工程学院</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p>\n<br/>\n<p> 相关附件:<br/>\n\n1、<a href=\"https://sece.sysu.edu.cn/docs/2025-06/20250604095903935151.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附表_申请表.docx\">申请表</a><br/>\n</p>\n</div>","textSha256":"3ddc3773b9a4bba50dceeae896fc65075162ee7c46a681bcc639a42ceec8ff79","textLength":1264,"sourceSha256":"1d558078ad87f5501d9a6ff2b05f3cb50acb7f6cdbb737bf321672667959df52","selector":".cont","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a093f24b771bbd92fad7","title":"2025年中山大学电子与通信工程学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:19:58.021881+00:00"}
